        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Fast. Drive Far. Unlock It All.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Velocity Racing: 1000</i> is a sleek, high-speed third - and first-person racing game created by a <strong>solo developer</strong> over 9 months. With sharp visuals, responsive vehicle handling, and full race customization, this is pure racing distilled into a tight, replayable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏎️ <strong>21 Unlockable Cars</strong> – Each with unique stats and designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>5 Diverse Maps</strong> – From winding forest roads to high-speed asphalt circuits (more maps coming!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ <strong>Dynamic Race Settings</strong> – Choose weather (including snow &amp; storms), day/night, laps, and NPC difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Customization</strong> – Pick your car color, view handling stats, and fine-tune race rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 <strong>Progression System</strong> – Unlock vehicles by driving longer distances and winning races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Steam Co-op Multiplayer</strong> – Join or host races with friends using Steam lobbies, with in-game and lobby chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> – End-of-race stats and global rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Crisp VFX and Smooth Controls</strong> – Clean UI, satisfying driving feel, and fast loading</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed solo with a focus on speed, freedom, and fun — <i>Velocity Racing: 1000</i> invites you to get behind the wheel and keep chasing distance.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Fast. Drive Far. Unlock It All.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Velocity Racing: 1000</i> is a sleek, high-speed third - and first-person racing game created by a <strong>solo developer</strong> over 9 months. With sharp visuals, responsive vehicle handling, and full race customization, this is pure racing distilled into a tight, replayable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏎️ <strong>21 Unlockable Cars</strong> – Each with unique stats and designs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>5 Diverse Maps</strong> – From winding forest roads to high-speed asphalt circuits (more maps coming!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌤️ <strong>Dynamic Race Settings</strong> – Choose weather (including snow &amp; storms), day/night, laps, and NPC difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Customization</strong> – Pick your car color, view handling stats, and fine-tune race rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊 <strong>Progression System</strong> – Unlock vehicles by driving longer distances and winning races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤝 <strong>Steam Co-op Multiplayer</strong> – Join or host races with friends using Steam lobbies, with in-game and lobby chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Leaderboards</strong> – End-of-race stats and global rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Crisp VFX and Smooth Controls</strong> – Clean UI, satisfying driving feel, and fast loading</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed solo with a focus on speed, freedom, and fun — <i>Velocity Racing: 1000</i> invites you to get behind the wheel and keep chasing distance.</p>",
        "short_description": "A sleek, customizable arcade-style racer built by a solo developer. Unlock 21+ cars, race across 5 detailed maps, tweak every setting, and compete solo or in co-op via Steam lobbies.",
